{"seq":3,"slug":"token-bucket-leaky-bucket","title":"令牌桶与漏桶：两种经典算法的深度实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/fundamentals/token-bucket-leaky-bucket","wordCount":933,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"令牌桶与漏桶-两种经典算法的深度实现\">令牌桶与漏桶：两种经典算法的深度实现</h1><p>令牌桶（Token Bucket）和漏桶（Leaky Bucket）是限流领域最经典的两个算法，也是系统设计面试的高频考点。两者都用「桶」作为隐喻，但解决的问题不同：令牌桶控制<strong>请求速率上限并允许突发</strong>，漏桶保证<strong>输出速率稳定</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>令牌桶与漏桶是限流领域最经典的两个算法，用「桶」作为隐喻但解决不同问题。令牌桶以固定速率向桶中<strong>填充令牌</strong>，每个请求消耗一个令牌，桶满时可积累令牌允许短时突发；漏桶以固定速率<strong>流出</strong>（处理请求），不允许突发但保证输出稳定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>令牌桶</th>\n<th>漏桶</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>允许突发</td>\n<td>是（桶容量决定突发量）</td>\n<td>否（严格固定速率）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出稳定性</td>\n<td>波动（可突发）</td>\n<td>平滑（恒定输出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合保护</td>\n<td>面向客户端（弹性）</td>\n<td>面向后端（稳定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心参数</td>\n<td>容量 + 填充速率</td>\n<td>队列长度 + 排出速率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"令牌桶算法\">令牌桶算法</h2><h3 id=\"数学模型\">数学模型</h3><p>令牌桶的状态可以用一对参数描述：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>容量（capacity）</strong>：桶最多能存放的令牌数，决定最大突发量</li>\n<li><strong>填充速率（refill_rate）</strong>：每秒向桶中添加的令牌数，决定平均速率上限</li>\n</ul>\n<p>系统状态随时间的变化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"tokens(t) = min(capacity, tokens(t₀) + refill_rate × (t - t₀))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>tokens(t) = min(capacity, tokens(t₀) + refill_rate × (t - t₀))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个请求到来时消耗指定数量的令牌（通常为 1），若令牌不足则拒绝请求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单机实现\">单机实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"class TokenBucket {&#10;  constructor(capacity, refillRate) {&#10;    this.capacity = capacity; // 桶容量（最大突发量）&#10;    this.refillRate = refillRate; // 令牌/秒&#10;    this.tokens = capacity; // 初始满桶&#10;    this.lastRefill = Date.now();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 请求 cost 个令牌，返回是否允许&#10;  consume(cost = 1) {&#10;    this._refill();&#10;    if (this.tokens &lt; cost) return false;&#10;    this.tokens -= cost;&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  _refill() {&#10;    const now = Date.now();&#10;    const elapsed = (now - this.lastRefill) / 1000; // 转为秒&#10;    const newTokens = elapsed * this.refillRate;&#10;    this.tokens = Math.min(this.capacity, this.tokens + newTokens);&#10;    this.lastRefill = now;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 返回距下次有令牌的等待时间（毫秒）&#10;  waitTime(cost = 1) {&#10;    this._refill();&#10;    if (this.tokens &gt;= cost) return 0;&#10;    const deficit = cost - this.tokens;&#10;    return Math.ceil((deficit / this.refillRate) * 1000);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用示例&#10;const limiter = new TokenBucket(10, 2); // 容量10，每秒填充2个令牌&#10;&#10;// 突发：连续 10 个请求，利用积累的令牌&#10;for (let i = 0; i &lt; 10; i++) {&#10;  console.log(limiter.consume()); // 前10个全部 true&#10;}&#10;console.log(limiter.consume()); // false，令牌耗尽\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TokenBucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">capacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">refillRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.capacity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capacity; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 桶容量（最大突发量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.refillRate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refillRate; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 令牌/秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capacity; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 初始满桶</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lastRefill </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 请求 cost 个令牌，返回是否允许</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  consume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_refill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  _refill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> elapsed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lastRefill) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 转为秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> newTokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.refillRate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.capacity, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newTokens);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lastRefill </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 返回距下次有令牌的等待时间（毫秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  waitTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_refill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> deficit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((deficit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.refillRate) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> limiter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TokenBucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 容量10，每秒填充2个令牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 突发：连续 10 个请求，利用积累的令牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(limiter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">consume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 前10个全部 true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(limiter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">consume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// false，令牌耗尽</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"可变成本令牌消耗\">可变成本令牌消耗</h3><p>令牌桶的一个强大特性是支持<strong>可变成本</strong>——不同操作消耗不同数量的令牌，实现更细粒度的速率控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const COSTS = {&#10;  &#39;GET /api/search&#39;: 1, // 普通查询&#10;  &#39;POST /api/export&#39;: 10, // 耗时操作&#10;  &#39;POST /api/batch&#39;: 5, // 批量接口&#10;};&#10;&#10;function handleRequest(req) {&#10;  const cost = COSTS[`${req.method} ${req.path}`] ?? 1;&#10;  if (!userBucket.consume(cost)) {&#10;    return { status: 429, retryAfter: userBucket.waitTime(cost) / 1000 };&#10;  }&#10;  // 继续处理&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COSTS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'GET /api/search'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 普通查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'POST /api/export'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 耗时操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'POST /api/batch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 批量接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COSTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">req</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">method</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">req</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userBucket.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">consume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cost)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">429</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, retryAfter: userBucket.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">waitTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cost) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 继续处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"redis-分布式实现\">Redis 分布式实现</h3><p>分布式环境下，需要将令牌桶状态存入 Redis，用 Lua 脚本保证原子性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- token_bucket.lua&#10;local key = KEYS[1]&#10;local capacity = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;local refill_rate = tonumber(ARGV[2])&#10;local cost = tonumber(ARGV[3])&#10;local now = tonumber(ARGV[4]) -- 毫秒时间戳&#10;&#10;local state = redis.call(&#39;HMGET&#39;, key, &#39;tokens&#39;, &#39;last_refill&#39;)&#10;local tokens = tonumber(state[1]) or capacity&#10;local last_refill = tonumber(state[2]) or now&#10;&#10;-- 计算应补充的令牌&#10;local elapsed = (now - last_refill) / 1000&#10;local refilled = math.min(capacity, tokens + elapsed * refill_rate)&#10;&#10;-- 检查是否有足够令牌&#10;if refilled &lt; cost then&#10;  -- 不修改状态，返回需等待的毫秒数&#10;  local deficit = cost - refilled&#10;  local wait_ms = math.ceil(deficit / refill_rate * 1000)&#10;  return {0, wait_ms}&#10;end&#10;&#10;-- 消耗令牌，更新状态&#10;local new_tokens = refilled - cost&#10;redis.call(&#39;HMSET&#39;, key, &#39;tokens&#39;, new_tokens, &#39;last_refill&#39;, now)&#10;redis.call(&#39;PEXPIRE&#39;, key, math.ceil(capacity / refill_rate * 1000 * 2))&#10;return {1, 0}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- token_bucket.lua</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local key = KEYS[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local capacity = tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local refill_rate = tonumber(ARGV[2])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local cost = tonumber(ARGV[3])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local now = tonumber(ARGV[4]) -- 毫秒时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local state = redis.call('HMGET', key, 'tokens', 'last_refill')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local tokens = tonumber(state[1]) or capacity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local last_refill = tonumber(state[2]) or now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 计算应补充的令牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local elapsed = (now - last_refill) / 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local refilled = math.min(capacity, tokens + elapsed * refill_rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 检查是否有足够令牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if refilled &#x3C; cost then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -- 不修改状态，返回需等待的毫秒数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local deficit = cost - refilled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local wait_ms = math.ceil(deficit / refill_rate * 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return {0, wait_ms}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 消耗令牌，更新状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local new_tokens = refilled - cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('HMSET', key, 'tokens', new_tokens, 'last_refill', now)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('PEXPIRE', key, math.ceil(capacity / refill_rate * 1000 * 2))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return {1, 0}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"漏桶算法\">漏桶算法</h2><h3 id=\"数学模型\">数学模型</h3><p>漏桶的隐喻：水（请求）以任意速率流入桶中，以<strong>固定速率</strong>从底部流出（被处理）。桶满时新来的请求被丢弃。</p>\n<p>两种实现变体：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>丢弃模式</strong>：桶满直接返回 429（常见于限流）</li>\n<li><strong>排队模式</strong>：桶满时请求进入等待队列（常见于流量整形）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"队列实现-排队模式\">队列实现（排队模式）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"class LeakyBucket {&#10;  constructor(capacity, drainRate) {&#10;    this.capacity = capacity; // 队列最大长度&#10;    this.drainRate = drainRate; // 每秒处理的请求数&#10;    this.queue = [];&#10;    this.processing = false;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 尝试加入队列&#10;  enqueue(request) {&#10;    if (this.queue.length &gt;= this.capacity) {&#10;      return { accepted: false, reason: &#39;bucket_full&#39; };&#10;    }&#10;    this.queue.push(request);&#10;    if (!this.processing) this._startDrain();&#10;    return { accepted: true, position: this.queue.length };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  _startDrain() {&#10;    this.processing = true;&#10;    const interval = 1000 / this.drainRate; // 每个请求间隔毫秒&#10;&#10;    const drain = () =&gt; {&#10;      if (this.queue.length === 0) {&#10;        this.processing = false;&#10;        return;&#10;      }&#10;      const req = this.queue.shift();&#10;      req.process(); // 实际处理请求&#10;      setTimeout(drain, interval);&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    setTimeout(drain, interval);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LeakyBucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"co